      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_062/audio/song/p04.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 7810
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p05",
      "text": "A fleece keeps out sleet, rain and cold. The wet just drips off it.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_062/pages/p05.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_062/audio/pages/p05.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 6817,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_062/audio/song/p05.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 6974
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p06",
      "text": "A fleece gets deeper week after week, so a sheep needs a clip in spring.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_062/pages/p06.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_062/audio/pages/p06.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 6086,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_062/audio/song/p06.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 6373
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p07",
      "text": "The clip is quick. A fleece comes off in one big sheet, and it does not hurt the sheep.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_062/pages/p07.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_062/audio/pages/p07.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 7079,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_062/audio/song/p07.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 8646
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p08",
      "text": "That fleece is spun to make yarn, and yarn makes socks that keep feet snug.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_062/pages/p08.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_062/audio/pages/p08.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 6608,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_062/audio/song/p08.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 7209
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p09",
      "text": "A wee sheep feeds on sheep milk. Sheep milk makes cheese, sharp and sweet.",
      "image": "books/mlr_dec_062/pages/p09.webp",
      "audio": "books/mlr_dec_062/audio/pages/p09.mp3",
      "duration_ms": 6608,
      "voice": "57785406027844b29b63a772a8477bc2",
      "has_video": false,
      "song_audio": "books/mlr_dec_062/audio/song/p09.mp3",
      "song_duration_ms": 7915
    },
